text = "Houses infected.
Breathing out spores. 
People transforming.
Made a mistake.
Salt dries the people out. 
Run to avoid mushroom people, facemasks useless.
Salt and then fire destroys the spore shooters. 
Salt water restores health for infected lungs.

Dr. Donovan"
